[{"title":"送致仕袁太守士瑩访旧南归","author":"倪岳","text":"结屋深依铁瓮城，可堪乡思忽然生。\n逢人便与留诗别，为客何妨载酒行。\n蓟北交游仍在望，淮南父老正相迎。\n永怀五马声华远，争羡孤鸿羽翼轻。\n六月长途真耐暑，七旬暮景岂干名。\n久知宦味如云薄，却笑吟身似鹤清。\n白日到门淹杖屦，清风满座倒瓶罂。\n犹惊明发还分手，四十年来故旧情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9091,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其一 西涯","author":"倪岳","text":"城北一西涯，城南一西涯。\n身外无穷地，相安即是家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9092,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其二 海子","author":"倪岳","text":"积水千年在，寒潭一镜开。\n楼台渺烟雾，何处近蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9093,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其三 西山","author":"倪岳","text":"君住西山下，时来却望君。\n不见山中树，只见山中云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9094,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其四 慈恩寺","author":"倪岳","text":"楼阁云中出，丹青水面开。\n江南何事者，寂寞雨花台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9095,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其五 饮马池","author":"倪岳","text":"汲水足饮马，索钱还济贫。\n可怜一掬地，于物复于人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9096,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其六 杨柳湾","author":"倪岳","text":"高柳抱晴湾，疏篱匝烟渚。\n犹记泊枫桥，隔水闻吴语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9097,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其七 桔槔亭","author":"倪岳","text":"桔槔在平林，辽辽怀汉阴。\n灌园者谁子，可解息机心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9098,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其八 钟鼓楼","author":"倪岳","text":"高楼严击柝，可怜更漏明。\n夜半人语绝，忽闻钟鼓声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9099,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其九 响闸","author":"倪岳","text":"奔涛鸣春雷，闸口疾如箭。\n怀哉百步洪，使我心胆战。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9100,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其十 月桥","author":"倪岳","text":"夜色落长桥，片月波心净。\n不见影娥池，鱼龙自窥映。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9101,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其十一 稻田","author":"倪岳","text":"腐儒常苦饥，问籴竟如玉。\n僧田不自耕，终岁饭亦足。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9102,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西涯杂题十二首为李宾之 其十二 莲池","author":"倪岳","text":"莲生失其地，羞与众芳伍。\n独笑采莲人，不识莲心苦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9103,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗送朱用辅北归省墓 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"暑雨发新霁，征车在都门。\n之子别我去，行逐燕然云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9104,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗送朱用辅北归省墓 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"燕然高插天，烟霞日来往。\n而君处其间，飘凌动遐想。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9105,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗送朱用辅北归省墓 其三","author":"倪岳","text":"君家好兄弟，玉树森以敷。\n季也更超特，落落珊瑚株。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9106,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗送朱用辅北归省墓 其四","author":"倪岳","text":"我昔有远游，逢君惨羁旅。\n异乡感新知，义气两相许。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9107,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗送朱用辅北归省墓 其五","author":"倪岳","text":"结交未三载，一别今十年。\n相见讵云疏，相思长自怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9108,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗送朱用辅北归省墓 其六","author":"倪岳","text":"君今得亨途，轻帆遇风便。\n龙门海之湄，超忽驶如箭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9109,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗送朱用辅北归省墓 其七","author":"倪岳","text":"客路良已达，客怀亦以深。\n双亲渺何许，伤此平生心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9110,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗送朱用辅北归省墓 其八","author":"倪岳","text":"归来一杯酒，聊慰九泉下。\n秋深有良贾，拟报连城价。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9111,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗送朱用辅北归省墓 其九","author":"倪岳","text":"旧游二三子，长才久争雄。\n相期桂子府，同上蓬莱宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9112,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗送朱用辅北归省墓 其十","author":"倪岳","text":"重阍天上遥，长桥雾中阁。\n葛陂一丈竹，倏忽弄头角。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9113,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗送朱用辅北归省墓 其十一","author":"倪岳","text":"君行急回首，望望黄金台。\n寄语谢诸君，为我联翩来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9114,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙子新秋","author":"倪岳","text":"梧叶惊风报早秋，天边时见火星流。\n深闺凉夜砧声起，总是关山客里愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9115,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨窗秋思","author":"倪岳","text":"秋雨萧萧向晚天，小窗坐久独忘眠。\n风前杨柳今摇落，一别乡关又几年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9116,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"居庸道中","author":"倪岳","text":"浮云出没翠微中，淡紫深青远近同。\n此景峥嵘真可畏，愁怀郁郁正无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9117,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴","author":"倪岳","text":"吟怀默默唤愁生，旧赏新游总未成。\n燕子不来春欲暮，萧然又过一清明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9118,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月十一日夜雪有感二首 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"每凭鱼雁问平安，一纸书回带泪看。\n最是夜深成独坐，白云南望雪漫漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9119,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月十一日夜雪有感二首 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"白云南望雪漫漫，遥想亲闱夜正寒。\n安得西风生两翼，一樽春酒奉清欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9120,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪事 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"一自开残上苑花，十年春色老京华。\n临风滴尽伤心泪，悔杀从前愿有家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9121,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪事 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"别院穷居岁月深，重门榛棘已森森。\n窗前一任春风去，誓不今生负此心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9122,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪事 其三","author":"倪岳","text":"心事无端重郁纡，更看寒燕引双雏。\n世人不戒前车覆，浪说程婴可托孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9123,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪事 其四","author":"倪岳","text":"闻道花开树树新，璚林地远绝风尘。\n独怜岁月催迟暮，肉食无人惜此春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9124,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊流河","author":"倪岳","text":"迢迢客路近流河，渔浦风晴起棹歌。\n夹道短篱村巷小，两行疏柳夕阳多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9125,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊东光县","author":"倪岳","text":"斜日阴阴起暮笳，船头画鼓不停挝。\n县门东去刚三里，正及郎官放晚衙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9126,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过故城遂泊八里屯","author":"倪岳","text":"萧条门巷不成村，细柳深藏卫尉屯。\n回首故城三十里，月明风冷送黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9127,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹二首 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"湘云流尽水痕乾，玉骨伤秋露气寒。\n饥凤夜深飞不去，也随群鸟宿江干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9128,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹二首 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"□□□稳楚江秋，灵瑟声寒泪不收。\n明月莫随流水去，好应长照梦中游。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9129,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雪有感 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"慈母恩深不可追，严亲犹隔大江隈。\n独怜洒泣东风里，惟有孤肠日九回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9130,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雪有感 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"三十光阴犹冉冉，寻常心事亦劳劳。\n叮咛说与檐头雪，休逐东风上鬓毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9131,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题岳蒙泉葡萄画 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"往年曾说蔡中郎，唾落骊珠颗颗香。\n却忆凉州辛苦地，个中滋味亦亲尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9132,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题岳蒙泉葡萄画 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"远道归来把一麾，转头零落又成悲。\n旧家只有葡萄在，从此无劳说荔支。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9133,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"一话孤身万斛愁，贫来偏易上心头。\n无端客枕难成梦，卧听寒更报晓筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9134,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"悠悠心事总堪愁，三十年来一转头。\n只恐蹉跎成老大，不知何处觅良筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9135,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中偶题芦雁遂成十绝 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"雁飞初到楚江头，叫破衡阳一段秋。\n寂寞西风明月夜，芦花如雪点汀洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9136,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中偶题芦雁遂成十绝 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"回雁峰前湘水头，随阳来往自春秋。\n月明远度黄龙塞，夜静长鸣白鹭洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9137,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中偶题芦雁遂成十绝 其三","author":"倪岳","text":"满地芦花笑白头，客怀牢落正惊秋。\n雁声和月回残梦，寒影翩翩下远洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9138,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中偶题芦雁遂成十绝 其四","author":"倪岳","text":"月明十二碧峰头，霜落沅湘水似秋。\n凉思也惊鸿雁侣，相呼相唤在河洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9139,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中偶题芦雁遂成十绝 其五","author":"倪岳","text":"燕尾沙长出水头，潇湘风月正新秋。\n翩翩寒雁投荒渚，簌簌霜芦带浅洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9140,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中偶题芦雁遂成十绝 其六","author":"倪岳","text":"萧萧凉月堕楼头，雁影初传紫塞秋。\n叫得客愁无处着，却随芦荻老孤洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9141,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中偶题芦雁遂成十绝 其七","author":"倪岳","text":"梧叶惊秋落井头，天涯旅客正悲秋。\n更堪月夜寒声起，江上菰蒲落雁洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9142,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中偶题芦雁遂成十绝 其八","author":"倪岳","text":"一曲清溪带石头，夜凉归思不胜秋。\n却怜远梦随征雁，飞落江南第几洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9143,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中偶题芦雁遂成十绝 其九","author":"倪岳","text":"水清沙碧没矶头，归雁声中两度秋。\n欲问稻粱何处好，西风彭蠡白蘋洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9144,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中偶题芦雁遂成十绝 其十","author":"倪岳","text":"楚水悠悠欲尽头，一双归雁远鸣秋。\n可应榆塞经过地，不及蘋江远近洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9145,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观史而倦辄成短句意或有在不复次第览者幸贷其拙云 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"妖艳承恩粉黛羞，君王一笑老温柔。\n须知祸水皆堪戒，岂特当时秪灭刘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9146,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观史而倦辄成短句意或有在不复次第览者幸贷其拙云 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"纨扇西风日日凉，凄清光景断人肠。\n慈帏供奉身何托，冷眼閒看岁月长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9147,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观史而倦辄成短句意或有在不复次第览者幸贷其拙云 其三","author":"倪岳","text":"失宠心怜梦亦惊，长门词赋若为情。\n东风别院笙歌醉，遥听春游翠辇行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9148,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观史而倦辄成短句意或有在不复次第览者幸贷其拙云 其四","author":"倪岳","text":"鳌极虽倾力可全，古来遗事已茫然。\n空怀五色山中石，大手何人解补天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9149,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观史而倦辄成短句意或有在不复次第览者幸贷其拙云 其五","author":"倪岳","text":"行自因循位自崇，空劳天下说中庸。\n一时碌碌成何补，怪底偏为世所容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9150,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观史而倦辄成短句意或有在不复次第览者幸贷其拙云 其六","author":"倪岳","text":"五代悠悠转盻间，安荣不动却如山。\n但知长乐全身地，大节孤忠总是闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9151,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观史而倦辄成短句意或有在不复次第览者幸贷其拙云 其七","author":"倪岳","text":"杵臼程婴事不同，托孤犹足亚桐宫。\n高风千载无人继，一节还宜数霍公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9152,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观史而倦辄成短句意或有在不复次第览者幸贷其拙云 其八","author":"倪岳","text":"肉食谁能与国谋，庙堂风采自优游。\n却怜漆室民间女，独抱深忧为鲁侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9153,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观史而倦辄成短句意或有在不复次第览者幸贷其拙云 其九","author":"倪岳","text":"抗疏殷勤十九章，一时须发总如霜。\n不知干进希名者，今日何人可颉颃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9154,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观史而倦辄成短句意或有在不复次第览者幸贷其拙云 其十","author":"倪岳","text":"闰月张灯已异常，无端灾乱起萧墙。\n仓忙烂额焦头者，剪发酬功计亦良。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9155,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题瀛洲学士图 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"等閒图画亦堪传，身在瀛洲不是仙。\n谁道当年闫立本，报功只解写凌烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9156,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题瀛洲学士图 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"绿杨深处对楸枰，黑白虚劳二子争。\n后着纵高人亦解，可怜功业在登瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9157,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题瀛洲学士图 其三","author":"倪岳","text":"日长台阁动丝桐，何处南薰续舜风。\n破阵功高元有曲，凭谁谱入七弦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9158,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题瀛洲学士图 其四","author":"倪岳","text":"天荣图书属上公，衣冠终日仰高风。\n悬知千载贞观治，不负当时讨论功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9159,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送薛侍御志渊使荆襄 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"流离赤子最堪怜，房竹山中有废田。\n耕凿几年皆帝力，岂烦膏血污戈鋋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9160,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送薛侍御志渊使荆襄 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"嗟君此去意如何，一道苍生望抚摩。\n往事已非空浩叹，功名岂为杀人多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9161,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送薛侍御志渊使荆襄 其三","author":"倪岳","text":"深山平地总王臣，莫论区区旧与新。\n但使熙然同乐业，使车到处即阳春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9162,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送薛侍御志渊使荆襄 其四","author":"倪岳","text":"十年两度说班师，此去人心恐见疑。\n传檄早须坚信约，君行休厌奏功迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9163,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中柳枝词 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"闻道吴侬歌竹枝，阿谁为续柳枝词。\n柳枝袅袅三千尺，解与行人绾别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9164,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中柳枝词 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"官河两岸插新杨，插得成行更望长。\n纵长只拂官河水，不似离人九曲肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9165,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中柳枝词 其三","author":"倪岳","text":"垂杨堤下水悠悠，欲行未行人自愁。\n高堂空忆儿归早，日日江头望客舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9166,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中柳枝词 其四","author":"倪岳","text":"杨柳新青拂水齐，牵舟人正满长堤。\n推篷忽见中天月，游子愁闻乌夜啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9167,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]